'''Mega Mawile ex''' (Japanese: '''メガクチートex''' ''Mega Kucheat ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

